VMware en proxmox

To run VMware and Proxmox on a server, you'll need a system with a 64-bit CPU (Intel 64 or AMD64) 
that supports hardware virtualization (Intel VT-x or AMD-V).
Proxmox requires at least 2 CPU cores, 2 GB of RAM (plus more for VMs), and 16 GB of disk space.
VMware ESXi generally requires more resources, 
with a minimum of 8 GB of RAM and 5 GB of disk space for installation, 
but more is recommended for production use (4 cores, 32 GB RAM, more disk space).

